# Story page: map
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Tunnel Map
---
A map of the endless tunnel, drawn in a shaky and decidedly snake-shaped hand.

Follow the line far enough and it bends, and bends again, and arrives exactly where it began. I have read many stories that do this, and I do not recommend any of them.

Written in the margin: STOP RUNNING. YOU ARE ALREADY THERE. The handwriting looks like {name}'s, which is impossible, as {name} has never held a pen.
